  "description": "Texas Distress is a bold vintage western font featuring authentic distressed textures and rugged cowboy-inspired letterforms. Designed to capture the spirit of the American frontier, this font blends rustic charm with strong visual impact, making it perfect for western branding, ranch logos, country music artwork, saloon signs, apparel designs, posters, packaging, and retro-themed projects. Its weathered appearance delivers a genuine handcrafted feel that adds character, nostalgia, and timeless western authenticity to any creative work.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Texas Distress is a bold vintage western font featuring authentic distressed textures and rugged cowboy-inspired letterforms. Designed to capture the spirit of the American frontier, this font blends rustic charm with strong visual impact, making it perfect for western branding, ranch logos, country music artwork, saloon signs, apparel designs, posters, packaging, and retro-themed projects. Its weathered appearance delivers a genuine handcrafted feel that adds character, nostalgia, and timeless western authenticity to any creative work.</p>",
